@Kvarkas, a question about the permanent "General" panel added in 91ff4282 (Sep 15).

In the current dev build, mRemoteNG always opens a "General" panel at startup. It can't be closed: the close button and the Close menu item are hidden, and closing it is cancelled. It also stays open when it has no connections in it.

From a user's view, this clutters the screen and doesn't seem to do anything. In 1.76, a panel only appeared when a connection opened in it, and closed with its last connection. W...
